# OmniCinema

Read `skills/omnicinema/SKILL.md` in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- Setup: `bash skills/omnicinema/scripts/bootstrap.sh` (`--with-render` adds Remotion; `--check`).
- Call: `bash skills/omnicinema/scripts/call.sh <tool> '<json>'` (or `@args.json`; `--list`).
- Inputs in English using the vocabulary in `references/workflows.md` §1;
  brand colours as hex codes in `style`.
- Videos: `run_cinema_pipeline` with `"dry_run": true` first; without stock
  keys the result is an animatic — say so.
- Check every output: `scripts/check_media.sh <files>` and LOOK at the
  `.check.png` / `.contact.png` previews before presenting.
- `generative:true`, `approveOverBudget`, `install_dependencies consent:true`
  only after an explicit yes. Keys live in `~/.cache/ai-skills/omnicinema-mcp/.env`, edited by the user.
